  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Feed Hungry School Children.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">No children should have to learn in an stomach. Our community based school feeding project is part of our hunger relief program where we deliver hot meals to school children in under-developed areas in Nigeria and Uganda. The food we provide goes hand-in-hand with the education these children receive. Your donation will feed &amp; get children out of the street and into school, increasing enrollment rate and reducing absenteeism. Giving them basic nutrients to grow and focus more on education.</narrative>
  </description>
